OL,3,GNEWSACoop win appeal against paying
OL,4,Aformer boss #600k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Channel Islands Coop has won an
OL,7,Fappeal against paying its former chief
OL,8,Fexecutive #600,000 in a compensation
OL,9,Fpayout.
OL,11,FColin MacLeod won a court case against
OL,12,Fthe Coop last year, claiming the
OL,13,Fcompany had treated him unfairly,
OL,14,Fleaving him with a psychiatric injury.
OL,15,FThe Coop challenged the decision.
OL,17,FIn May, judges originally ruled Coop
OL,18,Fwould have to pay the #600,000 despite
OL,19,Fthe appeal against the ruling not being
OL,20,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
