OL,3,GNEWSACoop win appeal against paying
OL,4,Aformer boss #600k
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 1 September, three appeal judges
OL,7,Fsided with the Coop, accepting MacLeod
OL,8,Fwas subjected to an unfair and
OL,9,Finappropriate campaign by some
OL,10,Fdirectors, but that it was "not
OL,11,Freasonably foreseeable that he would
OL,12,Fsustain a psychiatric injury" as a
OL,13,Fresult of the situation.
